{"appid": 2697930, "gama": {"steamId": 2697930, "id": 2697930, "name": "Commander Quest", "copiesSold": 90624, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1743724800000, "releaseDate": 1743724800000, "price": 11.99, "developers": ["Flyway Games, Inc."], "publishers": ["Flyway Games, Inc.", "KRAFTON, Inc."], "publisherClass": "Indie", "reviewScore": 75, "genres": ["Indie", "Simulation", "Strategy"], "tags": ["War", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Card Game", "Strategy", "Replay Value", "Deckbuilding", "Roguelike", "Card Battler", "Roguelite", "Auto Battler", "Choices Matter", "Mouse Only", "Minimalist", "Fantasy", "Casual", "Simulation", "Singleplayer", "3D", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Tactical"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "牌兵布阵 (Commander Quest)", "steam_appid": 2697930, "required_age": "12", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/d745c2325e7df2b60c621a1485d79246.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.mp4?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;召唤、指挥、夺取胜利。&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一款融合了<strong>构筑卡组类Roguelike玩法</strong>与<strong>自动战斗模拟器</strong>的游戏。<br>那些曾在历史上真实存在的传奇指挥官，如今将在一个充满魔法与诅咒、矮人与巨龙的奇幻世界中，再次率领军队征战沙场。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/15b0a580c071c6a46b5948e0c304583c.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.mp4?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;多样的种族和指挥官&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >选择战斗胜利后获得的奖励，灵活搭配多种卡牌与遗物，构筑属于你自己的独特卡组。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从冲破敌阵的骑兵、坚不可摧的钢铁矮人，到凶猛野兽和幽灵军团，多种协同组合正等待着你的策略决断。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完成理想的协同组合，弥补卡组短板，把握敌人的破绽，在不断增强的挑战中走向旅途的终点吧！<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/c8934b59c2018df14fd36d262b6fbe6f.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/73ed367070f5abcfb6f0c9536bf2799f.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/73ed367070f5abcfb6f0c9536bf2799f.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;丰富多样的游戏事件&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >旅途中等待你的不仅仅是战斗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可能会遇到一些出人意料的事件——比如保护老鼠群的环保组织，或者极力推销理财产品的地精商人。参与诡异实验来改造你的卡牌，或是获得强力遗物的奇妙体验也将展现在你面前。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一个选择都掌握在你手中。<br>你能否做出正确的决策，引领这场旅程走向最终的胜利？<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/7a6dc084d5d90a25e8bc816f797e44e1.webp?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/112401f573711f73b3141767a48c3473.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/112401f573711f73b3141767a48c3473.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/d745c2325e7df2b60c621a1485d79246.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.mp4?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;召唤、指挥、夺取胜利。&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一款融合了<strong>构筑卡组类Roguelike玩法</strong>与<strong>自动战斗模拟器</strong>的游戏。<br>那些曾在历史上真实存在的传奇指挥官，如今将在一个充满魔法与诅咒、矮人与巨龙的奇幻世界中，再次率领军队征战沙场。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/15b0a580c071c6a46b5948e0c304583c.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.mp4?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;多样的种族和指挥官&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >选择战斗胜利后获得的奖励，灵活搭配多种卡牌与遗物，构筑属于你自己的独特卡组。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从冲破敌阵的骑兵、坚不可摧的钢铁矮人，到凶猛野兽和幽灵军团，多种协同组合正等待着你的策略决断。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完成理想的协同组合，弥补卡组短板，把握敌人的破绽，在不断增强的挑战中走向旅途的终点吧！<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/c8934b59c2018df14fd36d262b6fbe6f.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/73ed367070f5abcfb6f0c9536bf2799f.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/73ed367070f5abcfb6f0c9536bf2799f.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;丰富多样的游戏事件&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >旅途中等待你的不仅仅是战斗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可能会遇到一些出人意料的事件——比如保护老鼠群的环保组织，或者极力推销理财产品的地精商人。参与诡异实验来改造你的卡牌，或是获得强力遗物的奇妙体验也将展现在你面前。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一个选择都掌握在你手中。<br>你能否做出正确的决策，引领这场旅程走向最终的胜利？<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/7a6dc084d5d90a25e8bc816f797e44e1.webp?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/112401f573711f73b3141767a48c3473.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/112401f573711f73b3141767a48c3473.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "恭喜你！你刚刚发现了一款独一无二的Roguelike游戏，结合了卡牌构筑和即时战略游戏！考虑单位之间的相克关系，然后通过打破战场和卡牌之间的界限，创造强大的协同作用，带领你的军队走向胜利！", "supported_languages": "英语, 韩语, 俄语, 日语, 简体中文, 德语", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/header_schinese.jpg?t=1754381787", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/9c7419cda6bb38f6839eeafc503de7fb5a1ae10d/capsule_231x87_schinese.jpg?t=1754381787", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/9c7419cda6bb38f6839eeafc503de7fb5a1ae10d/capsule_184x69_schinese.jpg?t=1754381787", "website": "https://www.krafton.com/studios/flyway-games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</str